WEBVTT

﻿1

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:05.004
[ no sound ]


00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:13.112
[ music ]


00:00:36.102 --> 00:00:37.936
Day one in the Browning house.


00:00:37.938 --> 00:00:40.806
It's moving in day


00:00:40.808 --> 00:00:43.842
Been going at it since
pretty early this morning.


00:00:43.844 --> 00:00:45.878
Uh, Stella should be home
in a couple of hours,


00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:49.982
and hopefully everything should
pretty much be in its place.


00:00:49.984 --> 00:00:52.051
No activity thus far.


00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:11.403
All right, house...
show me what you got.


00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.772
[ music sting ]


00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:38.864
[ orchestral Music ]


00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:40.852
Hey, lady.


00:03:40.854 --> 00:03:44.056
Hi.


00:03:44.058 --> 00:03:46.358
How was your day?


00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.594
It was good, it was very good.


00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.401
Wow!


00:03:56.403 --> 00:03:58.403
You got a lot done.


00:03:58.405 --> 00:03:59.538
Not too bad, right?


00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:00.439
Uh-uh.


00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:09.915
So...you ready for your
first night in a haunted house?


00:04:09.917 --> 00:04:13.452
As ready as I'll ever be.


00:04:13.454 --> 00:04:14.953
Oh, hold on one second,
I gotta show you something.


00:04:14.955 --> 00:04:16.488
Okay.


00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:34.906
Check those out.


00:04:34.908 --> 00:04:37.376
What are they?


00:04:37.378 --> 00:04:39.678
Those are pictures of the
house after the crime scene


00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.413
was cleaned up and there's even
one of the family in there.


00:04:47.587 --> 00:04:49.488
So this is them?


00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:50.555
Yeah.


00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:57.296
It's horrible to think
they all died in here.


00:05:06.339 --> 00:05:08.373
Who's bedroom was this?


00:05:08.375 --> 00:05:12.678
That was the little boy's room.


00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:17.849
I'd like you to play close
attention to that picture


00:05:17.851 --> 00:05:21.453
cause I would really love it
if you could decorate that room


00:05:21.455 --> 00:05:22.854
to look just like the picture
while I finish


00:05:22.856 --> 00:05:24.423
the office tonight.


00:05:24.425 --> 00:05:28.060
What?
Why would I do that?


00:05:28.062 --> 00:05:30.295
Well, supposedly, if you
recreate the house


00:05:30.297 --> 00:05:33.265
to look like it did when
they lived here,


00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:34.599
it can actually make
the spirits more active.


00:05:37.737 --> 00:05:39.004
Okay, that's a little creepy.


00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:43.475
You ready to go to work?


00:05:43.477 --> 00:05:46.111
No...


00:05:46.113 --> 00:05:48.814
Can't we just enjoy our first
night together?


00:06:04.297 --> 00:06:06.565
The box is already
in the room.


00:06:06.567 --> 00:06:12.237
But, when it's empty...


00:06:12.239 --> 00:06:13.705
[ laughs ]


00:06:18.311 --> 00:06:19.811
Doesn't seem right.


00:06:19.813 --> 00:06:21.713
Decorating a room
for a dead kid.


00:06:53.613 --> 00:06:55.547
Paul?


00:06:55.549 --> 00:06:58.283
What was the kid's name?


00:06:58.285 --> 00:07:00.852
Uh, it was Tom.


00:07:06.893 --> 00:07:08.360
Sorry about what
happened to you, Tom.


00:07:32.285 --> 00:07:34.920
There's definitely something
off about this place.


00:07:34.922 --> 00:07:38.890
it's like the air is
heavy or something.


00:07:38.892 --> 00:07:40.425
It has a certain
energy to it, doesn't it?


00:07:40.427 --> 00:07:42.427
Yeah... it's kind of exciting.


00:07:42.429 --> 00:07:43.862
Isn't it?


00:07:43.864 --> 00:07:48.633
Yeah... and a little creepy.


00:07:48.635 --> 00:07:51.703
No need to worry,
little lady, I'll protect you.


00:07:51.705 --> 00:07:55.140
Oh, well that's reassuring.


00:07:55.142 --> 00:07:58.310
Ouch.


00:07:58.312 --> 00:08:04.249
You're so mean to me
all the time.


00:08:04.251 --> 00:08:06.284
Oh, do you think they would
let us paint the walls


00:08:06.286 --> 00:08:08.320
while we're staying here?


00:08:08.322 --> 00:08:09.354
Yeah, I think so.


00:08:09.356 --> 00:08:12.057
Awesome.


00:08:12.059 --> 00:08:14.493
Why? What color
were you thinking?


00:08:14.495 --> 00:08:18.330
Well, you know how I like color,
and lots of it,


00:08:18.332 --> 00:08:21.666
so I was thinking, how about
a deep blood red.


00:08:21.668 --> 00:08:23.602
Blood red.


00:08:23.604 --> 00:08:26.638
Yeah, it'll match right?
The ghosts will like it.


00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:29.241
Yeah, it'll probably match what
the house used to look like.


00:08:29.243 --> 00:08:32.344
There was a lot
of blood on the walls.


00:08:32.346 --> 00:08:32.844
You didn't tell me that
something actually happened


00:08:32.846 --> 00:08:34.279
in this room.


00:08:34.281 --> 00:08:36.515
Yeah.


00:08:36.517 --> 00:08:39.751
Great, what?


00:08:39.753 --> 00:08:42.621
The guy shot his wife
in this room.


00:08:42.623 --> 00:08:45.156
Are you--
Exactly where you're
laying right now.


00:08:45.158 --> 00:08:46.358
Shut up.


00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:49.261
Wait.


00:08:49.263 --> 00:08:51.696
What?
What's that?


00:08:51.698 --> 00:08:52.597
Oh, look, it's brain matter.


00:08:52.599 --> 00:08:55.433
Oh, my god.


00:08:55.435 --> 00:08:57.969
Night. Thanks.


00:08:57.971 --> 00:09:01.172
Oh, come on.
I'm just teasing.


00:09:01.174 --> 00:09:02.607
Mm-hmm.


00:09:10.516 --> 00:09:13.084
[ music ]


00:09:24.463 --> 00:09:27.432
[ door creaking ]


00:09:36.876 --> 00:09:39.044
[ movement ]


00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:44.316
[ bang ]


00:09:44.318 --> 00:09:45.650
Paul...Paul wake up.


00:09:45.652 --> 00:09:48.219
Huh? What?


00:09:48.221 --> 00:09:51.523
I heard something moving
around out there.


00:09:51.525 --> 00:09:53.758
And didn't we shut
the door last night?


00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.560
Yeah, I think so.


00:09:55.562 --> 00:09:55.894
It's open now.


00:10:03.069 --> 00:10:06.037
Where are you going?


00:10:06.039 --> 00:10:09.341
I'm gonna go take a look.


00:10:09.343 --> 00:10:11.109
Who knows, maybe our experiences
will start tonight.


00:10:59.625 --> 00:11:00.825
Nothing.


00:11:11.804 --> 00:11:15.607
I know I heard something.


00:11:15.609 --> 00:11:18.710
It was probably just the
sounds of the house settling.


00:11:18.712 --> 00:11:23.314
We're not used to them yet.


00:11:23.316 --> 00:11:28.353
I swear it sounded like
someone moving around out there.


00:11:28.355 --> 00:11:31.956
I looked everywhere.
There was nothing there.


00:11:39.832 --> 00:11:41.032
Come here.


00:12:29.448 --> 00:12:31.416
Boo!
Ah!


00:12:31.418 --> 00:12:33.284
Asshole.


00:12:33.286 --> 00:12:36.187
Ooh, what's the matter?


00:12:36.189 --> 00:12:37.756
Haunted house got you
a little spooked?


00:12:37.758 --> 00:12:39.390
No, but you sneaking up on me
and yelling "boo"


00:12:39.392 --> 00:12:40.959
in my ear does.


00:12:40.961 --> 00:12:45.130
Hey, where's Stella?


00:12:45.132 --> 00:12:46.698
She break up with you already?


00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:47.132
She's at work.


00:13:03.149 --> 00:13:07.085
What are these?


00:13:07.087 --> 00:13:09.921
Oh, those are from, uh, after
the crime scene was cleaned up.


00:13:09.923 --> 00:13:11.122
No shit?


00:13:16.428 --> 00:13:18.797
No, why do you have
these exactly?


00:13:18.799 --> 00:13:19.931
I'm putting together the house
to look like it did


00:13:19.933 --> 00:13:21.800
when they lived here.


00:13:21.802 --> 00:13:25.637
That's a little sick, dude.


00:13:25.639 --> 00:13:28.306
It's supposed to make
ghosts more active.


00:13:28.308 --> 00:13:30.008
You really believe
in this stuff don't you?


00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:33.411
Yeah, I do.


00:13:33.413 --> 00:13:35.580
So, did you actually find out
what happened here?


00:13:35.582 --> 00:13:38.349
Yeah, I did.


00:13:38.351 --> 00:13:40.485
And it was definitely the father
who killed the family.


00:13:40.487 --> 00:13:41.886
There wasn't a break-in
or anything like that.


00:13:41.888 --> 00:13:44.355
Those were all just rumors.


00:13:44.357 --> 00:13:47.425
The details are a little bit
hazy but, the gist of it is,


00:13:47.427 --> 00:13:49.227
he shot his wife
in their bedroom,


00:13:49.229 --> 00:13:50.929
and then he shot the kids
in their rooms.


00:13:50.931 --> 00:13:52.397
He covered each of the bodies
with a sheet,


00:13:52.399 --> 00:13:54.833
and then he shot himself.


00:13:54.835 --> 00:13:57.035
And they found his body
in the living room


00:13:57.037 --> 00:14:00.939
sitting up in a dining room
chair, brains blown out.


00:14:00.941 --> 00:14:04.676
Kinda weird.


00:14:04.678 --> 00:14:06.611
Ah, I got a bunch of boxes
and stuff outside.


00:14:06.613 --> 00:14:07.846
Can you help me move those
into the garage?


00:14:07.848 --> 00:14:08.246
Yeah.


00:14:19.959 --> 00:14:21.759
[ metal banging ]


00:14:21.761 --> 00:14:24.629
Hey, be careful with that,
that's my radio.


00:14:24.631 --> 00:14:25.864
You still have not
finished this thing yet?


00:14:25.866 --> 00:14:28.199
Oh, my god.


00:14:28.201 --> 00:14:29.033
All right, I'm putting it here.


00:14:33.772 --> 00:14:37.575
Collecting dolls now?


00:14:37.577 --> 00:14:41.713
Yeah, Sam.
I'm collecting dolls now.


00:14:41.715 --> 00:14:43.715
It's Stella's.


00:14:43.717 --> 00:14:45.550
So, how is it?
Living with Stella?


00:14:48.087 --> 00:14:50.989
Yeah...


00:14:50.991 --> 00:14:54.092
It's... it's great.
I mean it's only been a day,


00:14:54.094 --> 00:14:55.827
but, she's still here.


00:14:55.829 --> 00:14:58.596
That's a good thing.


00:14:58.598 --> 00:15:03.101
What about you?
You got a fling of the month?


00:15:03.103 --> 00:15:04.469
Who is it this time?


00:15:04.471 --> 00:15:06.471
Uh, Summer?


00:15:06.473 --> 00:15:08.806
August?


00:15:08.808 --> 00:15:10.675
Moon?


00:15:10.677 --> 00:15:13.244
Chelsea, yeah, her name
was Chelsea.


00:15:13.246 --> 00:15:13.411
And?


00:15:16.282 --> 00:15:18.082
She was...immature.


00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:24.188
Too immature for <i>you?</i>


00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.457
Yeah, she didn't even
know how to cook.


00:15:26.459 --> 00:15:28.192
I did all the cooking.


00:15:28.194 --> 00:15:30.428
Treated her like a queen.


00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:32.430
And what did this queen eat?


00:15:32.432 --> 00:15:36.100
Macaroni and cheese? Hot dogs?


00:15:36.102 --> 00:15:37.669
A little grilled cheese
on special occasions?


00:15:37.671 --> 00:15:38.970
And hamburgers...


00:15:38.972 --> 00:15:42.941
Frickin bomb.


00:15:42.943 --> 00:15:44.976
You know what you need?


00:15:44.978 --> 00:15:48.513
You need to find a girl who's
exactly like your mom.


00:15:48.515 --> 00:15:49.514
Somebody who'll take care
of you, and will cook you


00:15:49.516 --> 00:15:50.782
three meals a day.


00:15:50.784 --> 00:15:53.284
Yeah...


00:15:53.286 --> 00:15:54.986
Which shouldn't be that
difficult, seeing as your mom


00:15:54.988 --> 00:15:57.055
really was not a good cook.


00:15:57.057 --> 00:15:58.623
Better than your mom.


00:15:58.625 --> 00:16:01.993
You're mom never cooked.


00:16:01.995 --> 00:16:05.129
Yeah, that's cause she
died when I was seven.


00:16:05.131 --> 00:16:06.698
That's what I'm sayin'.


00:16:12.371 --> 00:16:15.139
You realize we're getting old.


00:16:15.141 --> 00:16:18.242
It's not even 11 o'clock
on Friday and we're in bed.


00:16:18.244 --> 00:16:22.880
You're getting old, I'm not.


00:16:22.882 --> 00:16:25.416
Nice try,
You're older than I am.


00:16:25.418 --> 00:16:28.886
Ah, so, grandma wanted
to know something.


00:16:28.888 --> 00:16:31.122
Um...


00:16:31.124 --> 00:16:34.625
I know...


00:16:34.627 --> 00:16:37.528
I know you want to write a book
about the house and all, but...


00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:39.731
Why?


00:16:39.733 --> 00:16:42.200
I think it's a good time
right now.


00:16:42.202 --> 00:16:45.536
I mean, everything that has
anything to do


00:16:45.538 --> 00:16:47.739
with paranormal activity
is huge right now.


00:16:47.741 --> 00:16:51.542
I know, but, what's driving you?


00:16:51.544 --> 00:16:54.312
Fame...fortune.


00:16:54.314 --> 00:16:56.814
Stop.


00:16:56.816 --> 00:16:58.850
Seriously, what's behind it?


00:17:05.958 --> 00:17:08.092
I want to prove to myself
that I can actually


00:17:08.094 --> 00:17:09.460
finish something I start.


00:17:13.165 --> 00:17:16.401
I'm thirty.


00:17:16.403 --> 00:17:20.338
I'm a part-time ad writer
for a newspaper.


00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:22.507
My biggest accomplishment
has been writing an obituary.


00:17:27.513 --> 00:17:30.581
I want to be somebody that
you can be proud of.


00:17:32.284 --> 00:17:33.584
I am proud of you.


00:17:36.155 --> 00:17:37.455
You are?


00:17:37.457 --> 00:17:41.793
Yes.


00:17:41.795 --> 00:17:46.864
And I'm excited to see you
really excited about something.


00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:32.877
[ door shut ]


00:18:34.546 --> 00:18:36.080
Paul?


00:18:41.553 --> 00:18:42.920
This isn't funny, Paul!


00:19:49.021 --> 00:19:50.821
[ phone ringing ]


00:20:02.134 --> 00:20:04.969
Hi, mom.


00:20:04.971 --> 00:20:06.037
I'm good, how are you?


00:20:09.274 --> 00:20:12.710
He's doing good.


00:20:12.712 --> 00:20:15.813
What do you want me to tell him?


00:20:15.815 --> 00:20:17.882
Okay.
[ laughs ]


00:20:33.165 --> 00:20:34.865
[ banging noise ]


00:21:23.548 --> 00:21:25.716
Yeah, you want us
to be over there Sunday?


00:21:25.718 --> 00:21:27.184
Yeah, I could bring
whatever you want.


00:21:27.186 --> 00:21:30.621
[ dragging sound ]


00:21:30.623 --> 00:21:33.457
Mom, can I call you right back?


00:21:33.459 --> 00:21:35.626
Yeah. Okay, bye.


00:21:57.449 --> 00:21:59.350
Paul?


00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:22.767
[ radio static ]


00:23:55.267 --> 00:23:56.801
[ whimpering ]


00:24:09.481 --> 00:24:11.549
Oh my god, what happened?


00:24:12.083 --> 00:24:13.984
Hey.


00:24:15.620 --> 00:24:17.154
Hey, Stel, are you okay?


00:25:05.370 --> 00:25:07.605
I can't stay here anymore.


00:25:27.459 --> 00:25:29.593
Please, don't go.


00:25:32.430 --> 00:25:35.633
I can't live in this house
anymore, Paul.


00:25:35.635 --> 00:25:39.703
There's something bad here.


00:25:39.705 --> 00:25:42.640
I thought you wanted
to have experiences.


00:25:42.642 --> 00:25:46.977
I did, but, I thought it
was gonna be orbs of light,


00:25:46.979 --> 00:25:49.813
maybe...maybe silhouettes...
something friendly.


00:25:49.815 --> 00:25:52.616
This is not friendly.


00:25:52.618 --> 00:25:54.285
Just, wait, wait, wait.


00:26:01.059 --> 00:26:03.193
Please, sit down.


00:26:15.173 --> 00:26:19.643
Please, just stay the night.


00:26:19.645 --> 00:26:22.746
I won't leave your side,
I promise.


00:26:22.748 --> 00:26:25.449
And if you still want to leave
in the morning


00:26:25.451 --> 00:26:28.519
then we can talk about it.


00:26:28.521 --> 00:26:31.088
Just don't run out like this.


00:26:31.090 --> 00:26:33.924
I'm scared, Paul.


00:26:33.926 --> 00:26:36.760
This thing could hurt us.


00:26:36.762 --> 00:26:38.062
Come with me.


00:26:41.700 --> 00:26:42.766
I can't.


00:26:42.768 --> 00:26:46.203
Why not?


00:26:46.205 --> 00:26:48.639
If I walk away from this, this
is just one more thing that...


00:26:48.641 --> 00:26:50.941
that I didn't finish.


00:26:50.943 --> 00:26:54.178
Stel, I need this.


00:26:54.180 --> 00:26:59.116
So, you'd pick the house
over me?


00:26:59.118 --> 00:27:00.985
I didn't say that.


00:27:00.987 --> 00:27:02.186
And that's not fair.


00:27:11.396 --> 00:27:16.300
Please.


00:27:16.302 --> 00:27:20.471
I'm asking you, just stay
the night.


00:27:20.473 --> 00:27:22.139
We'll figure it all out
in the morning.


00:27:25.510 --> 00:27:26.577
For me?


00:27:28.880 --> 00:27:30.280
Okay.


00:27:34.185 --> 00:27:35.953
Come here.


00:27:40.825 --> 00:27:44.728
[ music ]


00:28:47.826 --> 00:28:49.493
Stel?


00:29:29.701 --> 00:29:31.068
[ phone ringing ]


00:29:34.973 --> 00:29:37.341
Hello?


00:29:37.343 --> 00:29:40.410
Hey... hey, I just
got your note.


00:29:40.412 --> 00:29:42.412
Sorry.


00:29:42.414 --> 00:29:45.582
Just had to get out of there.


00:29:45.584 --> 00:29:50.087
That's okay, you had
quite a scare last night.


00:29:50.089 --> 00:29:51.221
So what time are you
gonna head back over?


00:29:55.026 --> 00:29:58.061
I can't live there.


00:29:58.063 --> 00:30:00.597
I know it means
a lot to you but...


00:30:00.599 --> 00:30:02.065
I'm just not comfortable
staying there.


00:30:03.535 --> 00:30:05.402
Okay...


00:30:08.006 --> 00:30:09.940
Well, this sucks.


00:30:09.942 --> 00:30:14.211
I know...


00:30:14.213 --> 00:30:16.013
Can I call you later?
my mom's taking me to breakfast.


00:30:17.615 --> 00:30:19.917
Yeah, all right.


00:30:21.753 --> 00:30:23.420
Okay, talk to you later.


00:31:02.160 --> 00:31:03.627
[ noises ]


00:31:11.302 --> 00:31:13.737
[ Children Whispering ]
<i>- I told you to be quiet.</i>


00:31:13.739 --> 00:31:16.874
<i>- I didn't do it on purpose.</i>


00:31:16.876 --> 00:31:18.709
<i>- If you're gonna play this</i>
<i>game, you have to be quiet.</i>


00:31:18.711 --> 00:31:20.677
<i>We don't want to wake him up.</i>


00:31:20.679 --> 00:31:23.347
<i>- I'm sorry.</i>


00:31:23.349 --> 00:31:24.815
<i>- Just don't do it again.</i>


00:31:24.817 --> 00:31:27.751
<i>- Okay.</i>


00:31:27.753 --> 00:31:29.486
<i>- You ready?</i>
<i>- Yes.</i>


00:31:29.488 --> 00:31:31.521
<i>- Okay, go hide.</i>


00:31:31.523 --> 00:31:35.425
<i>One, two, three, four, five</i>


00:31:35.427 --> 00:31:41.498
<i>six, seven, eight, nine, ten.</i>


00:31:41.500 --> 00:31:42.733
<i>Ready or not, here I come.</i>


00:32:40.224 --> 00:32:41.792
<i>I hear something.</i>


00:33:09.187 --> 00:33:10.020
<i>He's coming.</i>


00:33:42.787 --> 00:33:43.920
[ child laughing ]


00:34:47.885 --> 00:34:49.019
I could hear you talking.


00:34:58.229 --> 00:35:01.298
Can you do what you were
doing again?


00:35:03.801 --> 00:35:04.968
I just want to talk to you.


00:35:13.845 --> 00:35:15.212
Can you give me some sort
of sign of your presence?


00:35:18.783 --> 00:35:21.084
Can you knock on something?


00:35:21.086 --> 00:35:23.019
Or move something?


00:35:29.794 --> 00:35:31.228
Anything?


00:36:00.892 --> 00:36:02.959
COMPUTER: You've got mail!


00:36:04.629 --> 00:36:06.062
[ laughs ]


00:36:50.007 --> 00:36:53.009
What the hell is this?


00:36:53.011 --> 00:36:54.778
[ scream ]


00:37:34.285 --> 00:37:35.218
[ phone ringing ]


00:37:39.257 --> 00:37:40.790
Sup, dude?


00:37:40.792 --> 00:37:43.660
You asshole!


00:37:43.662 --> 00:37:44.794
What the hell are you doing
sending me this for


00:37:44.796 --> 00:37:46.529
in the middle of the night?


00:37:46.531 --> 00:37:48.298
I didn't think you were
still gonna be a awake.


00:37:48.300 --> 00:37:50.433
That was a cheap shot.


00:37:50.435 --> 00:37:51.935
Did it make you jump?


00:37:51.937 --> 00:37:53.303
Yeah, it made me jump.


00:37:53.305 --> 00:37:56.106
It scared the crap out of me.


00:37:56.108 --> 00:37:57.107
<i>They have this website</i>
<i>that you can go to</i>


00:37:57.109 --> 00:37:59.309
to make all this cool stuff.


00:37:59.311 --> 00:38:01.344
I mean, they have the...you know
obviously the photo editing


00:38:01.346 --> 00:38:02.979
aspect of it but they
got the audio too,


00:38:02.981 --> 00:38:04.948
I mean it's fantastic.


00:38:04.950 --> 00:38:06.616
<i>You got the crossfades,</i>
<i>and the delays even,</i>


00:38:06.618 --> 00:38:08.184
<i>auto-tuning--</i>


00:38:58.903 --> 00:39:00.337
[ music sting ]


00:39:41.645 --> 00:39:43.279
[ doorbell ]


00:40:03.134 --> 00:40:04.134
Hey, Paul.


00:40:04.136 --> 00:40:06.002
Hey, Skip.


00:40:06.004 --> 00:40:07.804
Here to pick up the rent.


00:40:07.806 --> 00:40:09.806
Oh, yeah. Come on in.


00:40:09.808 --> 00:40:11.107
Okay.


00:40:20.151 --> 00:40:21.651
Here you go.


00:40:21.653 --> 00:40:23.520
Thanks.


00:40:23.522 --> 00:40:25.722
Uh, Skip, while you're
here, um...


00:40:25.724 --> 00:40:27.390
do you mind if I ask you
a couple questions


00:40:27.392 --> 00:40:28.758
about the house?


00:40:28.760 --> 00:40:30.193
Sure.


00:40:30.195 --> 00:40:31.828
Do you wanna have a seat?


00:40:31.830 --> 00:40:34.431
Hmmm.


00:40:34.433 --> 00:40:37.200
Let's go outside, it's nice out.


00:40:37.202 --> 00:40:38.535
Can I get you something?


00:40:38.537 --> 00:40:39.736
Water'd be good.


00:40:39.738 --> 00:40:40.804
Sure.


00:40:53.751 --> 00:40:56.619
So, Skip, how long have
you actually


00:40:56.621 --> 00:40:58.354
owned this house for?


00:40:58.356 --> 00:41:01.724
Um...about eleven years now.


00:41:01.726 --> 00:41:04.561
The previous tenants that
lived here, um, did they


00:41:04.563 --> 00:41:06.729
tell you why they moved out?


00:41:06.731 --> 00:41:08.398
No, they had their reasons.


00:41:08.400 --> 00:41:11.901
Did any of them mention


00:41:11.903 --> 00:41:13.436
things happening in the house
that they couldn't explain?


00:41:13.438 --> 00:41:16.706
Like what?


00:41:16.708 --> 00:41:19.876
Like ghosts?


00:41:19.878 --> 00:41:22.111
Why? You seen something?


00:41:22.113 --> 00:41:24.614
No, not personally.


00:41:24.616 --> 00:41:25.782
But with all the stories
about this place,


00:41:25.784 --> 00:41:27.884
I was really hoping to.


00:41:27.886 --> 00:41:30.987
Sometimes, stories
is just stories.


00:41:30.989 --> 00:41:34.224
Have you seen anything
in the house?


00:41:34.226 --> 00:41:36.993
Well I have to say, there...


00:41:36.995 --> 00:41:39.796
there is something off
about this place.


00:41:39.798 --> 00:41:41.731
Why did you move out?


00:41:41.733 --> 00:41:44.167
Oh, I never lived here.


00:41:44.169 --> 00:41:47.070
My...my parents owned it
and they rented it out


00:41:47.072 --> 00:41:48.771
and when they died,
I inherited it.


00:41:48.773 --> 00:41:51.140
Wait.


00:41:51.142 --> 00:41:53.243
Did your parents own the
house when the murders happened?


00:41:53.245 --> 00:41:55.278
Yeah, they was rentin' it.


00:41:55.280 --> 00:41:57.413
What were those people like?


00:41:57.415 --> 00:41:59.315
I didn't know 'em that well.


00:41:59.317 --> 00:42:01.651
They was good people though.


00:42:01.653 --> 00:42:05.021
It's a shame what happened.


00:42:05.023 --> 00:42:07.657
Any information that I can get
from you on those people,


00:42:07.659 --> 00:42:09.092
or any of the other tenants,
I'd really appreciate it.


00:42:11.462 --> 00:42:13.029
Why you so interested in this?


00:42:17.334 --> 00:42:21.271
I'm writing a book on the house.


00:42:21.273 --> 00:42:24.107
But, don't worry,
I'm not gonna use names.


00:42:24.109 --> 00:42:26.943
I'm not gonna use addresses
or anything like that.


00:42:26.945 --> 00:42:28.177
This is just a story about me
living in a haunted house.


00:42:28.179 --> 00:42:30.380
That's it.


00:42:30.382 --> 00:42:32.015
That's the stupidest thing
I ever heard.


00:42:37.288 --> 00:42:40.023
I will tell you though...


00:42:40.025 --> 00:42:42.659
Somethin' scared those
people out of this house.


00:42:42.661 --> 00:42:45.862
One lady was worried
about her kid.


00:42:45.864 --> 00:42:48.865
Can you tell me how I can
get in touch with her?


00:42:48.867 --> 00:42:50.833
No, they didn't leave
no forwarding address


00:42:50.835 --> 00:42:51.868
or nothin'.


00:42:51.870 --> 00:42:53.670
Can you give me her name?


00:42:53.672 --> 00:42:55.338
I just want to track her down,


00:42:55.340 --> 00:42:56.406
and see if maybe,
she might be willing


00:42:56.408 --> 00:42:59.709
to talk to me.
That's it.


00:42:59.711 --> 00:43:02.412
Some things are just
better left alone.


00:43:02.414 --> 00:43:04.414
I seem to be hearing that
a lot lately.


00:43:04.416 --> 00:43:06.149
Well, maybe you should listen.


00:43:08.018 --> 00:43:09.719
Look, I gotta go.


00:43:09.721 --> 00:43:10.853
I got a delivery coming
this afternoon.


00:43:22.232 --> 00:43:24.567
Thanks for stopping by.


00:43:24.569 --> 00:43:25.568
And I do have some more
questions for you


00:43:25.570 --> 00:43:27.036
at another time.


00:43:28.906 --> 00:43:31.608
Skip?


00:43:31.610 --> 00:43:33.576
Yeah?


00:43:33.578 --> 00:43:35.612
Yeah, I'll be in touch.


00:43:44.288 --> 00:43:46.656
If you need anything,
I'm the house in the back.


00:44:12.016 --> 00:44:13.383
[ bang ]


00:45:12.543 --> 00:45:15.378
[ strange noise ]


00:46:25.449 --> 00:46:26.649
[ music sting ]


00:46:42.132 --> 00:46:43.065
[ bed creaking ]


00:47:04.354 --> 00:47:05.888
[ music sting ]


00:47:43.060 --> 00:47:44.260
PAUL ON PHONE:
Hi, is this Judy Peterson?


00:47:47.497 --> 00:47:49.732
Hi, Judy, my name
is Paul Anderson.


00:47:49.734 --> 00:47:51.167
I live in a house that you
used to live in.


00:47:51.169 --> 00:47:56.272
Uh, 8928 Maple Street.


00:47:56.274 --> 00:47:57.707
I was just hoping that maybe
I could ask you


00:47:57.709 --> 00:48:01.344
a couple questions about
the time that you lived there?


00:48:01.346 --> 00:48:04.580
Hello?


00:48:08.685 --> 00:48:09.919
What a bitch!


00:49:39.876 --> 00:49:41.610
Don't go in there.


00:49:41.612 --> 00:49:42.812
That lady's crazy.


00:50:03.934 --> 00:50:05.167
[ doorbell ]


00:50:20.083 --> 00:50:21.217
[ doorbell ]


00:50:26.556 --> 00:50:28.224
Said I was coming.


00:50:28.226 --> 00:50:30.226
I'm sorry, I didn't hear you.


00:50:30.228 --> 00:50:32.595
Are you Sue Dryer?


00:50:32.597 --> 00:50:33.996
Who are you?


00:50:33.998 --> 00:50:35.931
I'm Paul Anderson.


00:50:35.933 --> 00:50:38.100
Yeah, what do you want?


00:50:38.102 --> 00:50:40.403
I live in your old house
on Maple Street.


00:50:40.405 --> 00:50:42.405
I was really hoping that you
and I could, uh,


00:50:42.407 --> 00:50:44.173
talk about your time living--


00:50:44.175 --> 00:50:45.808
Is this some
sort of a sick joke?


00:50:45.810 --> 00:50:46.876
Did my husband send you?


00:50:49.413 --> 00:50:50.980
I don't know your husband.


00:50:50.982 --> 00:50:52.815
Do you people get some
sort of sick thrill


00:50:52.817 --> 00:50:54.617
out of tormenting me.


00:50:54.619 --> 00:50:56.619
I just...I live in the house
that you used to live in,


00:50:56.621 --> 00:50:58.587
and I thought maybe we could
talk about it.


00:50:58.589 --> 00:50:59.989
Get off my property
before I call the cops!


00:51:04.828 --> 00:51:10.633
Look, I'm really sorry if I
upset you, I wasn't trying to.


00:51:10.635 --> 00:51:12.201
I just wanted to find out
if maybe you had


00:51:12.203 --> 00:51:16.972
some strange experiences
in the house.


00:51:16.974 --> 00:51:19.008
I'm looking for validation.


00:51:22.779 --> 00:51:26.816
Here, I'm gonna leave my
business card in your mailbox.


00:51:26.818 --> 00:51:28.184
You can call me any time.


00:52:01.251 --> 00:52:04.253
[ radio static ]


00:52:53.170 --> 00:52:55.905
[ music ]


00:54:21.591 --> 00:54:24.827
I just don't get it.


00:54:24.829 --> 00:54:28.697
I mean, I'm trying everything
and nothing is working.


00:54:28.699 --> 00:54:29.865
I'm even setting my alarm
to wake me up


00:54:29.867 --> 00:54:31.433
in the middle of the night


00:54:31.435 --> 00:54:33.769
cause that's when they say
ghosts are more active.


00:54:33.771 --> 00:54:36.705
Nothing.


00:54:36.707 --> 00:54:39.875
I mean, I have
a lot of testimonials.


00:54:39.877 --> 00:54:42.044
But...


00:54:42.046 --> 00:54:44.913
nothing crazy you know, like,


00:54:44.915 --> 00:54:47.983
like someone getting attacked,
or...or possessed.


00:54:47.985 --> 00:54:51.053
Those are the things people
want to read about.


00:54:51.055 --> 00:54:54.556
They don't want to read about
cabinets opening by themselves.


00:54:54.558 --> 00:54:56.392
Okay, uh, would you actually
want it to attack you?


00:54:56.394 --> 00:54:59.662
No.


00:54:59.664 --> 00:55:03.465
But I do need something
big to happen to me.


00:55:03.467 --> 00:55:07.169
You're out of your
frickin' mind.


00:55:07.171 --> 00:55:09.772
You, sir, are obsessed.


00:55:09.774 --> 00:55:13.976
I just need that one
big thing.


00:55:13.978 --> 00:55:16.111
This book.


00:55:16.113 --> 00:55:18.514
It's gotta be great.


00:55:22.619 --> 00:55:25.921
[ music ]


00:55:43.840 --> 00:55:46.608
[  door creaking  ]


00:55:54.117 --> 00:55:55.284
[  covers rustling  ]


00:56:00.724 --> 00:56:02.558
Mm.


00:56:31.988 --> 00:56:33.655
[ music sting ]


00:57:06.956 --> 00:57:08.424
[ music sting ]


00:57:24.240 --> 00:57:25.674
[ music sting ]


00:58:36.613 --> 00:58:38.247
[  phone rings  ]


00:58:56.132 --> 00:58:59.768
Hello?


00:58:59.770 --> 00:59:03.705
This is Paul, who's this?


00:59:03.707 --> 00:59:06.542
Who?


00:59:06.544 --> 00:59:11.613
Oh, Sue, hi.


00:59:11.615 --> 00:59:15.384
Yeah, I would love to, um...


00:59:15.386 --> 00:59:19.955
uh, yeah, I'll be over in just
a couple of minutes.


00:59:19.957 --> 00:59:22.224
Great, thank you so much.
I'll see you soon.


00:59:22.226 --> 00:59:24.560
Okay, bye.


00:59:47.016 --> 00:59:51.153
Thank you for calling.


00:59:51.155 --> 00:59:54.356
I didn't think
I was gonna hear from you.


00:59:54.358 --> 00:59:57.993
I wasn't going to, but...


00:59:57.995 --> 01:00:00.729
when you said "validation,"
well, I could use some to.


01:00:07.170 --> 01:00:09.705
So, um, how long have you
lived there?


01:00:09.707 --> 01:00:11.039
Just over two months now.


01:00:16.946 --> 01:00:19.214
So what are you
interested in, in me?


01:00:24.320 --> 01:00:28.790
I rented the house, because I
had heard of the stories of it


01:00:28.792 --> 01:00:31.727
being haunted, I'm writing
a book on the house,


01:00:31.729 --> 01:00:35.130
and my experiences in it.


01:00:35.132 --> 01:00:37.699
And I know that you lived there,
so I was really hoping


01:00:37.701 --> 01:00:41.303
that maybe you could share some
of your experiences with me.


01:00:41.305 --> 01:00:42.504
I think maybe you should leave.


01:00:42.506 --> 01:00:43.372
Wait.


01:00:43.374 --> 01:00:46.408
Please, Sue...


01:00:46.410 --> 01:00:47.609
just talk to me?


01:00:51.280 --> 01:00:54.182
I would really love to hear your
experiences, and get your story.


01:01:00.390 --> 01:01:01.957
Can I?


01:01:04.627 --> 01:01:09.398
If at the end, if you don't want
me to use any of this,


01:01:09.400 --> 01:01:10.799
I'll give you the tape,
and...and you can keep it.


01:01:18.574 --> 01:01:20.442
Interview with Sue Dryer,
former tenant of the house.


01:01:23.579 --> 01:01:25.180
I just made some tea,
would you like some?


01:01:27.583 --> 01:01:42.431
Yeah, that would be great.


01:01:42.433 --> 01:01:44.166
So, did you have any strange
experiences in the house?


01:01:47.270 --> 01:01:49.237
If you're referring to the house
being haunted,


01:01:49.239 --> 01:01:52.507
yes, I did.


01:01:52.509 --> 01:01:56.278
Did it... uh, start as soon as
you moved in?


01:01:56.280 --> 01:01:57.979
No.


01:01:57.981 --> 01:02:01.817
At first it was great.


01:02:01.819 --> 01:02:04.186
I loved the house


01:02:04.188 --> 01:02:07.522
And my son's school was right
down the street.


01:02:07.524 --> 01:02:11.426
I was the president of the PTA.


01:02:11.428 --> 01:02:14.663
My husband's work was close by,
and the yard was great


01:02:14.665 --> 01:02:16.498
for my son to play in.


01:02:16.500 --> 01:02:19.501
He loved that yard.


01:02:19.503 --> 01:02:21.470
He would spend hours just
running around,


01:02:21.472 --> 01:02:24.639
he never got tired.


01:02:24.641 --> 01:02:26.374
So, when did things change?


01:02:28.111 --> 01:02:29.845
About two weeks in.


01:02:33.182 --> 01:02:38.854
Drawers and cabinets opened,
voices...


01:02:38.856 --> 01:02:41.823
At first I thought it was neat.


01:02:41.825 --> 01:02:43.391
I've always been fascinated
with the idea of ghosts.


01:02:49.198 --> 01:02:52.234
I even bought one of those
tape recorders,


01:02:52.236 --> 01:02:54.369
I was starting to try
to communicate with it.


01:02:56.205 --> 01:02:58.006
Did you get anything?


01:02:58.008 --> 01:03:01.209
Not really.


01:03:01.211 --> 01:03:06.348
Some strange sounds
and things, but...


01:03:06.350 --> 01:03:08.583
no voices or names or anything.


01:03:18.227 --> 01:03:19.294
Thank you.


01:03:27.937 --> 01:03:30.071
But then... it got stronger.


01:03:32.575 --> 01:03:34.910
Things started happening
more often.


01:03:34.912 --> 01:03:36.144
What kind of things?


01:03:38.748 --> 01:03:41.416
Doors would open and shut
on their own.


01:03:41.418 --> 01:03:44.619
Shadows... and those sheets.


01:03:48.057 --> 01:03:49.357
People under sheets?


01:03:52.595 --> 01:03:54.129
You've seen them too.


01:04:00.236 --> 01:04:02.737
Did they ever interact with
you in any way?


01:04:02.739 --> 01:04:04.506
I got pushed.


01:04:04.508 --> 01:04:06.842
Pushed?


01:04:06.844 --> 01:04:07.909
How?


01:04:09.745 --> 01:04:14.115
I was going down toward
the bedroom, and I got pushed


01:04:14.117 --> 01:04:18.353
from behind.


01:04:18.355 --> 01:04:24.159
Was it Like a...like a shove
or just a soft push?


01:04:24.161 --> 01:04:26.228
Hard enough to knock me down.


01:04:29.498 --> 01:04:33.835
I told my husband about it,
he didn't believe me.


01:04:33.837 --> 01:04:36.438
I was worried about my son,
I didn't want anything


01:04:36.440 --> 01:04:38.673
to happen to him.


01:04:38.675 --> 01:04:40.308
What did you do?


01:04:40.310 --> 01:04:44.179
I told him I wanted to move.


01:04:44.181 --> 01:04:46.815
And he just kept saying that I
was making excuses,


01:04:46.817 --> 01:04:48.416
trying to get him to move
back to Colorado.


01:04:51.554 --> 01:04:53.889
But those things that were
happening were real.


01:04:53.891 --> 01:04:55.924
-I know.
I believe you.


01:05:02.965 --> 01:05:07.636
It had this way of alienating me
from my husband and son.


01:05:07.638 --> 01:05:10.071
It tormented me, but it never
showed itself to them.


01:05:12.708 --> 01:05:16.645
So, your husband and your son
never had any experiences?


01:05:16.647 --> 01:05:17.212
No.


01:05:20.549 --> 01:05:24.352
Well, my son had
an imaginary friend.


01:05:24.354 --> 01:05:27.489
He's so creative.


01:05:27.491 --> 01:05:30.492
Your son's imaginary friend...


01:05:30.494 --> 01:05:32.727
Did it have a name?


01:05:32.729 --> 01:05:34.396
Yes it did, what was it?


01:05:34.398 --> 01:05:36.231
It was um...


01:05:36.233 --> 01:05:37.933
it was Tom.


01:05:41.771 --> 01:05:44.873
Um...


01:05:44.875 --> 01:05:47.442
so, what... what happened in
the house after you got pushed?


01:05:52.782 --> 01:05:54.783
My husband and I started
fighting about it all the time.


01:05:59.255 --> 01:06:02.590
That house killed my marriage.


01:06:02.592 --> 01:06:04.926
He even took me in
for a psych evaluation.


01:06:04.928 --> 01:06:06.261
A psych evaluation?


01:06:10.199 --> 01:06:12.100
So it...it never did show itself
to your husband?


01:06:12.102 --> 01:06:15.603
No.


01:06:15.605 --> 01:06:18.506
I think it purposefully
did that to separate us.


01:06:21.110 --> 01:06:25.280
I think it liked torturing me.


01:06:25.282 --> 01:06:27.349
I think it wanted to kill me.


01:06:30.720 --> 01:06:33.321
Did it do anything that would
give you the idea


01:06:33.323 --> 01:06:34.889
that it wanted to kill you?


01:06:36.726 --> 01:06:37.792
Yes.


01:06:40.129 --> 01:06:43.565
The day of the psych evaluation.


01:06:43.567 --> 01:06:46.901
My husband came home and told me
he had enrolled our son


01:06:46.903 --> 01:06:48.403
in day care because he didn't
trust me with him.


01:06:53.642 --> 01:06:55.710
We had a huge fight about it.


01:06:55.712 --> 01:07:00.015
And then, he took off.


01:07:00.017 --> 01:07:03.918
And I started screaming
at the house.


01:07:03.920 --> 01:07:05.320
It was ruining my marriage.


01:07:08.991 --> 01:07:11.059
And then...


01:07:11.061 --> 01:07:13.828
everything got still


01:07:13.830 --> 01:07:16.231
And...


01:07:16.233 --> 01:07:20.235
the doors slammed shut.


01:07:20.237 --> 01:07:22.103
I felt a hand on the back
of my head,


01:07:22.105 --> 01:07:23.338
and my face slammed
into the floor.


01:07:26.242 --> 01:07:27.942
What happened?


01:07:27.944 --> 01:07:29.344
What did you do?


01:07:30.613 --> 01:07:31.980
I don't remember anything else.


01:07:35.284 --> 01:07:37.752
I woke up in the hospital
to a restraining order.


01:07:37.754 --> 01:07:40.288
My husband thought I slammed my
head into the floor


01:07:40.290 --> 01:07:41.790
because of our fight.


01:07:41.792 --> 01:07:42.257
What?


01:07:46.262 --> 01:07:48.196
He got full custody of my son.


01:07:51.867 --> 01:07:53.668
I ended up back on the psych
ward for three months.


01:07:56.972 --> 01:07:58.106
That house.


01:08:01.577 --> 01:08:02.944
It took my life from me.


01:08:06.282 --> 01:08:08.283
All the more reason
for your story to be told.


01:08:12.054 --> 01:08:13.288
I think you should leave now.


01:08:28.270 --> 01:08:29.003
Hey, Sue?


01:08:33.409 --> 01:08:34.242
I'm really sorry for everything
that you went through.


01:08:40.015 --> 01:08:42.350
You have to get
out of there now!


01:08:42.352 --> 01:08:43.952
Don't you understand?
It's trying to kill you!


01:08:43.954 --> 01:08:46.821
You're hurting my arm.


01:08:46.823 --> 01:08:48.456
It'll alienate you
from everyone,


01:08:48.458 --> 01:08:49.991
and then it'll come after you!


01:08:49.993 --> 01:08:56.831
If it's showing itself to you,
it's only gonna get stronger!


01:08:56.833 --> 01:08:59.067
You have to get out of there!
It's going to kill you!


01:09:02.004 --> 01:09:03.872
Hail Mary, full of grace.


01:09:03.874 --> 01:09:05.874
The Lord is with thee,
blessed art thou amongst women,


01:09:05.876 --> 01:09:07.275
and blessed is the fruit
of thy womb, Jesus.


01:09:07.277 --> 01:09:08.343
Hail Mary, full of grace!


01:09:32.168 --> 01:09:33.568
[ radio static ]


01:10:32.094 --> 01:10:33.661
[ loud noise ]


01:11:03.292 --> 01:11:04.892
[ dragging noise ]


01:12:56.305 --> 01:12:57.638
[ radio static ]


01:13:11.453 --> 01:13:13.755
[ "Pop Goes the Weasel"
instrumental playing  ]


01:13:24.299 --> 01:13:26.567
[ music ]


01:13:33.275 --> 01:13:34.208
[ radio clicks off ]


01:14:28.664 --> 01:14:30.097
Tom?


01:14:31.533 --> 01:14:32.800
[ door creaks and shuts ]


01:15:05.567 --> 01:15:07.935
Tom, is that you?


01:15:45.240 --> 01:15:48.309
You don't have to be
afraid of me, Tom.


01:15:49.411 --> 01:15:49.877
I'm not gonna hurt you.


01:15:55.851 --> 01:15:56.651
Why don't you bring
the flashlight


01:15:56.653 --> 01:15:57.585
out here and play, Tom?


01:16:05.861 --> 01:16:07.161
Tom?


01:17:19.401 --> 01:17:21.702
[ recorder recording ]


01:17:29.444 --> 01:17:31.812
[ recorder plays silence ]


01:17:55.504 --> 01:17:56.837
I know you're here,
so just talk to me!


01:18:09.184 --> 01:18:11.352
[ recorder plays silence ]


01:19:18.787 --> 01:19:20.721
[ music ]


01:19:43.111 --> 01:19:44.145
Where are you?


01:19:57.325 --> 01:19:58.225
[ frustrated yelling ]


01:20:31.326 --> 01:20:34.028
Yeah, you're a big man!


01:20:34.030 --> 01:20:36.497
You can shoot your wife in bed,
and you can kill your kids


01:20:36.499 --> 01:20:38.199
and you won't even come out
and show yourself to me?


01:20:39.167 --> 01:20:41.735
[ frustrated yelling ]


01:20:56.518 --> 01:20:57.451
Where are you!


01:21:01.823 --> 01:21:03.724
[ music sting ]


01:21:05.727 --> 01:21:10.164
[ sinister music ]


01:21:28.550 --> 01:21:29.783
I Just...


01:21:31.920 --> 01:21:32.953
Want to talk to you.


01:21:41.263 --> 01:21:42.663
[ music sting ]


01:22:51.232 --> 01:22:53.233
[ tape recorder squeals ]


01:23:21.763 --> 01:23:22.830
[ electrical clicking ]


01:23:27.168 --> 01:23:28.235
[ electrical clicking ]


01:25:09.737 --> 01:25:12.139
[ squeaking ]


01:25:58.553 --> 01:26:01.455
[ traffic noises ]


01:26:19.007 --> 01:26:20.807
[ Phone rings ]


01:26:30.852 --> 01:26:33.420
Hey, Sam.


01:26:33.422 --> 01:26:35.489
<i>Hey, buddy, just calling</i>
<i>to check up on you.</i>


01:26:35.491 --> 01:26:38.792
<i>Did the guys come by and drop</i>
<i>off your stuff or what?</i>


01:26:38.794 --> 01:26:40.761
No, the movers said
they probably wouldn't be here


01:26:40.763 --> 01:26:41.995
until tomorrow.


01:26:41.997 --> 01:26:44.264
<i>Cool.</i>


01:26:44.266 --> 01:26:47.668
Hey, thanks again for getting
those last couple of boxes,


01:26:47.670 --> 01:26:49.469
I just couldn't go over there.


01:26:49.471 --> 01:26:51.038
<i>Dude, you okay?</i>


01:26:51.040 --> 01:26:54.675
Yeah, I'm fine.


01:26:54.677 --> 01:26:56.343
But I should probably
get back to it so, um,


01:26:56.345 --> 01:26:57.678
I'll talk with you later.


01:26:57.680 --> 01:26:58.145
<i>Don't be a stranger.</i>


01:26:58.147 --> 01:27:00.147
Okay.


01:27:00.149 --> 01:27:00.881
<i>All right,</i>
<i>talk to you later, Ciao.</i>


01:27:00.883 --> 01:27:02.282
Bye.


01:27:47.962 --> 01:27:48.929
[Gasps]


01:28:41.015 --> 01:28:42.015
[ music sting ]


01:28:45.586 --> 01:28:49.089
[ orchestral Music ]

